       "endIndex": 1087,
       "text": "Google standardly frontloads initial equity grants rather than using an even 25%/year split"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1089,
       "endIndex": 1179,
       "text": "A typical frontloaded schedule is **33% / 33% / 22% / 12%** (or **38% / 32% / 20% / 10%**)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1438,
       "endIndex": 1469,
       "text": "| **GSU Vesting (33/33/22/12)**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 1704,
       "endIndex": 1773,
       "text": "*(If using the 38/32/20/10 schedule, Year 1 TC crosses **$1,020,000**"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2038,
       "endIndex": 2120,
       "text": "**The Year 3/4 \"Cliff\":** Because Google frontloads equity, Years 3 and 4 drop off"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2122,
       "endIndex": 2194,
       "text": "However, Google grants **annual equity refreshers** based on performance"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       2
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2196,
       "endIndex": 2312,
       "text": "Starting in Year 2, those annual refreshers stack on top of your initial grant to backfill the drop in Years 3 and 4"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2454,
       "endIndex": 2552,
       "text": "**Sign-on ($200,000):** Well above standard L6 sign-ons (which typically range from $50k to $100k)"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2554,
       "endIndex": 2621,
       "text": "Google used this to neutralize your unvested Meta equity completely"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2625,
       "endIndex": 2723,
       "text": "**Equity ($1.34M):** Standard L6 initial GSU grants typically land between $800,000 and $1,100,000"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 2725,
       "endIndex": 2820,
       "text": "At $1.34M ($335k/year average), Google has already calibrated you at the top end of the L6 band"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     },
     {
      "segment": {
       "startIndex": 3777,
       "endIndex": 3835,
       "text": "Equity has the most flexibility in Google's hiring budgets"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
       0
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
